menu "Example Configuration"

    config EXAMPLE_MANUAL_ENABLE_WIFI_STA
        bool "Stage 2: bring up Wi-Fi STA"
        default y
        help
            After the hosted link is up, manually init the host Wi-Fi feature and
            connect a station to obtain an IP. Disable to demonstrate transport
            configuration + core link only.

    config EXAMPLE_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi SSID"
        default "myssid"
        help
            SSID the STA connects to (defaults match the emulator SoftAP).

    config EXAMPLE_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password"
        default "mypassword"

    config EXAMPLE_MANUAL_ENABLE_BLE_ADV
        bool "Stage 3: bring up BLE advertising"
        default y
        help
            After the hosted link is up, set up the NimBLE host over the hosted HCI
            (controller on the coprocessor) and start advertising. Disable to skip BLE.

endmenu
